  "summary": "Air conditioning (RPO C60): the right- and left-hand side outlet ducts under the instrument panel that feed the dash-end A/C vents, with their seals to the center outlet duct and selector, and the swivel deflector (under-dash vent ball) at the bottom of each side duct. The center outlet duct is screwed to the selector over a cemented seal; the LH side duct is screwed up into a clip nut on an instrument panel bracket; each deflector is stacked with felts and an adapter and held by a retainer and screw, set to a rotating effort of 8-24 oz.",
